### 4. Update AdminArticleForm

In `src/pages/AdminArticleForm.js`:

**Replace MDEditor:**
```jsx
// OLD (remove this):
import MDEditor from '@uiw/react-md-editor';
<MDEditor value={content} onChange={setContent} />

// NEW (add this):
import TiptapEditor from '../components/TiptapEditor';
<TiptapEditor value={content} onChange={setContent} placeholder="Write your article content here..." />
```

**Keep everything else:**
- Current form structure with sections
- Title input
- Category select
- Tags input
- Image upload functionality
- Submit/save logic
- All validation

### 5. Styling Requirements

**TiptapEditor.css should include:**
- Clean, modern toolbar design matching existing UI
- Proper spacing and alignment
- Active/disabled button states
- Table styling (borders, headers, hover effects)
- Responsive design
- Matches the Atom/green theme used in the app
- Image styling within editor
- Code block styling

**Example base styles:**
```css
.tiptap-editor {
  border: 1px solid #dee2e6;
  border-radius: 0.5rem;
  background: white;
}

.tiptap-toolbar {
  display: flex;
  gap: 0.25rem;
  padding: 0.5rem;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #dee2e6;
  background: #f8f9fa;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.tiptap-toolbar button {
  padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;
  border: 1px solid #dee2e6;
  background: white;
  border-radius: 0.25rem;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.tiptap-toolbar button:hover {
  background: #e9ecef;
}

.tiptap-toolbar button.is-active {
  background: #28a745;
  color: white;
  border-color: #28a745;
}

.ProseMirror {
  padding: 1rem;
  min-height: 400px;
  outline: none;
}

/* Table styles */
.ProseMirror table {
  border-collapse: collapse;
  width: 100%;
  margin: 1em 0;
}

.ProseMirror table td,
.ProseMirror table th {
  border: 1px solid #ddd;
  padding: 8px;
  text-align: left;
  min-width: 50px;
}

.ProseMirror table th {
  background-color: #f2f2f2;
  font-weight: bold;
}
```

